  "body_html": "<p>Professor Mark Radford has been honoured with an award for <strong>Outstanding Service in Prevention of Blindness</strong> from the Asia Pacific Academy of Ophthalmology. The Academy delivered the award at its 2025 Annual Congress in Hong Kong, marking another career highlight for QEIF’s Executive Director and CEO. The Award recognises Professor Radford’s ongoing commitment to collaborative research and his drive to strengthen clinical capacity in the region, particularly in low-resourced communities through RANZCO’s Global Eye Health programs.</p>\n<p>In another nod to Queensland’s strength in the sector, Professor Timothy Sullivan, who is active in clinical research and an honorary clinical scientist at QEI, received a Senior Achievement Award from the Academy.</p>\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-6522\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\" id=\"attachment_6522\" style=\"width: 640px\"><img alt=\"Two men in suits wearing lanyards around their necks stand side by side in the foyer of a large conference centre. They both hold certificates and are smiling at the camera.\" class=\"wpa-warning wpa-image-missing-alt wp-image-6522 size-large\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"480\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" src=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2026/03/20260206_QEI-AsiaPacificOphthalmologyAssocCongress-1_Web-1024x768.jpg\" srcset=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2026/03/20260206_QEI-AsiaPacificOphthalmologyAssocCongress-1_Web-1024x768.jpg 1024w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2026/03/20260206_QEI-AsiaPacificOphthalmologyAssocCongress-1_Web-300x225.jpg 300w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2026/03/20260206_QEI-AsiaPacificOphthalmologyAssocCongress-1_Web-768x576.jpg 768w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2026/03/20260206_QEI-AsiaPacificOphthalmologyAssocCongress-1_Web-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2026/03/20260206_QEI-AsiaPacificOphthalmologyAssocCongress-1_Web-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2026/03/20260206_QEI-AsiaPacificOphthalmologyAssocCongress-1_Web-1430x1073.jpg 1430w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2026/03/20260206_QEI-AsiaPacificOphthalmologyAssocCongress-1_Web-800x600.jpg 800w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2026/03/20260206_QEI-AsiaPacificOphthalmologyAssocCongress-1_Web-400x300.jpg 400w\" width=\"640\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\" id=\"caption-attachment-6522\">Professor Mark Radford (left) with Professor Tim Sullivan</figcaption></figure>\n</div>",
